// --- AGGREGATED ENGINE ---
anyBreakUp   = t1Up or t2Up or t3Up or t4Up or t5Up or t6Up or t7Up or t8Up or t9Up or t10Up or t11Up or t12Up or t13Up or t14Up or t15Up or t16Up or t17Up or t18Up or t19Up or t20Up or t21Up or t22Up or t23Up or t24Up or t25Up or t26Up or t27Up
anyBreakDown = t1Down or t2Down or t3Down or t4Down or t5Down or t6Down or t7Down or t8Down or t9Down or t10Down or t11Down or t12Down or t13Down or t14Down or t15Down or t16Down or t17Down or t18Down or t19Down or t20Down or t21Down or t22Down or t23Down or t24Down or t25Down or t26Down or t27Down

